Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:21.18,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(629.083,448.246)\\fade(255,0,255,0,850,4650,5380)}Episode 43\N \N\N\N\NGānlù Temple
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord... why do you seem upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of your loose tongue, \Nmy plan has been ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:08.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(358.044,458.182)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5340,5700)}Sūn Quán\NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.98,0:04:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, the State Mother will have a gathering at Ganlu temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If she does not like Liu Bei, \Nthat will let me deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But if she likes him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,our bluff will become reality\N and we will become family!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:29.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(292.436,503.377)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5300,5740)}Lǚ Fàn\NStyled: Zǐhéng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.73,0:04:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is half a century old whilst \Nyour sister is young and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.78,0:04:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How could the State Mother like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,With State Elder Qiao around her,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.11,0:04:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot say that my mother will decline him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, even if the State Mother likes him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,she would not accept him as a son-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that is her wish, how can I even disobey it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My liege,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,one cannot ever be completely filial or loyal since antiquity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.27,0:05:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.34,0:05:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,At the meeting at Ganlu temple tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter if the State Mother likes him or not, \Nwe cannot keep him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.35,0:05:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will order Jia Hua to bring 300 men with sabers. They will stand in ambush in the corridor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and as soon as you drop a cup as a signal,\Nthey will charge in from both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Liu Bei and Zhao Yun will be slain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We have done exactly what the Strategos advised.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:47.52,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(985.245,485.455)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4340,4680)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why come we have not received any news yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:57.28,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(309.765,465)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5500,5860)}Zhào Yún\NStyled Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Strategos has divine foresight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that this case is no different.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder Qiao visited State Mother Wu this afternoon and will be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:05.64,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(304.933,442.597)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5060,5380)}Sūn Qián\NStyled: Gōngyòu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.90,0:06:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We will get a response soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:06.52,Thinking,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, State Elder Qiao wishes to inform you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,that State Mother Wu shall meet you at Ganlu temple tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This meeting feels off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.99,0:06:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I will make preparations beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, please get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.71,0:07:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you'll meet the State Mother tomorrow. Why don't you retire early?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.65,0:07:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, I am more than 50 years old. \NMy hair is turning gray.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan's sister, however, is of a young age.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,For State Mother Wu, her daughter is her treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.67,0:07:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear misfortune at tomorrow's meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you have great ambitions in your heart and you have a heroic demeanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine State Mother Wu is not any average person herself
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and will certainly value your bearing and manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the looks of a dragon \Nand a phoenix. You will gain her favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You really know what to say to console me, Zilong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I will gather 500 men to act as your bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You should also wear thin armor under your robes just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.85,0:08:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.23,0:09:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.85,0:09:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.44,0:09:53.60,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(997.527,410.455)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3820,4150)}State Elder Qiáo
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder, has the Imperial Uncle arrived?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have just been informed that he is awaiting your summons in front of Mount Beigu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him that I wish to see him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.51,0:10:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already set the ambush on both sides,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting for you to drop the cup as our signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that everything is set, summon Liu Bei at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the one in the front dressed in brocade Liu Xuande?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.45,0:10:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,His looks are extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.80,0:11:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.81,0:11:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I bothered you to welcome me in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.81,0:11:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be so courteous, Imperial Uncle. \NThe State Mother awaits you inside this hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle Liu has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.86,0:11:37.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(926.567,315)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,6000,6000)}State Mother Wú
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I pay respects to you, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.05,0:11:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rise, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Honorable Marquis, may you have good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Likewise, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder, I hope you too are in good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, you have the looks of a dragon and a phoenix
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and the semblance of Heaven and the Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your virtue and benevolence spreads across the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,To get such a noble son-in-law is great news, great as Heaven itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.22,0:12:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You think too highly of me, State Elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.91,0:12:58.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I must thank you for your matchmaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.71,0:13:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, where is the other matchmaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Qian is currently waiting outside the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite him in. Let us begin the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.32,0:13:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.49,0:13:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, the banquet is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.58,0:13:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.49,0:13:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please drink to your heart's content!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, State Elder. Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder, he truly is a noble son-in-law!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.11,0:14:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuande, who is that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.15,0:14:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhao Yun of Changshan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he the one that rescued Adou
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.93,0:14:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,fending off thousands of soldiers \Nin Dangyang, at Changban Slope?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.99,0:14:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That is Zhao Zilong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.93,0:15:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong and I are as close as brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-A formidable general! \N-Indeed he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him some wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.91,0:15:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I am most grateful, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I just took a look around the corridors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.23,0:15:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw some men in ambush wielding sabers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Sun Quan wants to kill you. \NInform the State Mother at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.61,0:15:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, if you want to kill me, then kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuande, why are you saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:16:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There are armed men hiding in the corridors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.49,0:16:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're there not to kill me, then what for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stand, Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongmou.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.48,0:16:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuande will soon be my son-in-law and shall be like my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.75,0:16:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have assassins ambushing in the corridors?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is this your doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.49,0:16:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziheng... you would dare to ruin my excitement
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,by killing Xuande before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have some nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.47,0:16:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.71,0:16:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Jia Hua! Do you intend to rebel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.09,0:17:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The cup was thrown to signal me. \NI was just following orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him away! Off with his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother! State Mother! This is a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.73,0:17:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, executing a major general is ill luck for our marriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Madame, if you insist, I will remain on my knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuande, please stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, please calm yourself! Calm yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.73,0:17:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, have some mercy, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, State Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.28,0:18:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jia Hua, were it not for the Imperial Uncle, I would have taken your worthless head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.49,0:18:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life, State Mother!\N Thank you, Imperial Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, State Elder, please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.77,0:19:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,670)}Oh, great Heaven above!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}{\pos(640,670)}If I am to safely return to Jing Province
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.27,0:19:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}and fulfill my imperial designs,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}may I split this rock in two with a swing of my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}If I am to perish in this land
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}may the rock remain whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, why are you so violent to a rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.13,0:20:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}I am almost 50, but I have\Nnot yet killed the villains of the land
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}and restored the house of Hàn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}I find it most regrettable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.89,0:20:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Now that the State Mother \Naccepts me as her son-in-law,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.39,0:20:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}I am most fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}I was just asking Heaven to predict my future:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.90,0:20:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}if I can defeat the Cao and revive the Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}it would let me split that rock in two!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}I did not think it would actually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.55,0:20:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}Then I shall ask Heaven about my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.96,0:20:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}If I can kill the traitor \NCao Cao, let me cut this rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.51,0:20:58.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}Oh, Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:01.36,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}if I can seize Jing Province and make Wu great,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:03.36,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}let me slice this rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongmou, your swordsmanship is on point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.03,0:21:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The same can be said of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, do you know the landscape of Mount Beigu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.29,0:21:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then follow me, Lord Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.48,0:22:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}This is the most beautiful landscape in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.64,0:22:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}I often hear people say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}"Southerners sail on boats; \Nnortherners ride horses."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}Now I see those words were not false after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.86,0:22:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Lord Xuande, do you believe southerners are not used to riding horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me my steed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.59,0:22:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says southerners cannot ride horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.24,0:22:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. I shall accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.60,0:23:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander! The State Mother has \Naccepted Liu Bei. The marriage shall go through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:40.48,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(381.475,489.35)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3820,4180)}Zhōu Yú\NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.82,0:23:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Liu Bei now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.05,0:23:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He is still inside his lodging in Nanxu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.08,0:23:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We were sent by the Marquis of Wu \Nto tell you that the beauty ruse backfired.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.66,0:23:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the Marquis of Wu to keep watch around the lodging house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.72,0:23:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let Liu Bei leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:23:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait for an opportunity to act. Do not delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.00,0:24:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.51,0:24:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, State Elder Qiao informs us that
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.13,0:24:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the State Mother chose the 26th day of this month for the marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.54,0:24:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It is ten days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.51,0:24:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Very well. That decision has\N been finalized, so I should be at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.78,0:24:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I fear such a long delay spells disaster for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.73,0:24:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the State Mother's favor;\N Sun Quan will not dare change things himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.38,0:24:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu is bullheaded and his plan has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.40,0:24:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't give up easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.14,0:24:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He has likely planned another way to harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.05,0:24:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This requires the help of State Elder Qiao.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.19,0:24:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongyou, meet State Elder Qiao tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.69,0:25:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him that many in Eastern Wu want to harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.19,0:25:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask him to think of a way to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.50,0:25:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.03,0:25:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.90,0:25:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.73,0:25:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuande fears that there are those that want to hurt him. He wants to return to Jing Province soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.25,0:25:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And who would be bold enough to touch even a hair from my son-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.42,0:25:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, it is best to be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.10,0:25:41.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Invite Xuande to move to my residence for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.61,0:25:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We will wait for the day of the marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.26,0:25:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.54,0:25:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the Imperial Uncle comes alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.31,0:25:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and does not bring Zhao Yun and his cadre, \Nnobody will be able to contain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.54,0:25:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, problems may arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.62,0:26:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Then tell them all to move with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.68,0:26:03.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Excellent! Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.90,0:26:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come, let us oversee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.04,0:26:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.74,0:26:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.24,0:26:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, what is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.68,0:26:32.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(315.868,508.051)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3400,3620)}Lǔ Sù\NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.05,0:26:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The State Mother has led Liu Bei and Zhao Yun to reside in her mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.64,0:26:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The marriage will happen soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.02,0:26:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.54,0:26:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How did Liu Bei get a step ahead of us again?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.98,0:26:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lord has sent someone \Nto ask you what we should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.03,0:27:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I have let down our lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.30,0:27:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it has come to this,\N give me some time to plan it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.31,0:28:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin the ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.62,0:28:21.84,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Beautiful flowers in the spring forests; the spring birds sing with sorrow;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.62,0:28:21.84,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k141}Chūn {\k151}lín {\k85}huā {\k75}duō {\k159}mèi, {\k43}chūn {\k120}niǎo {\k78}yì {\k77}duō {\k271}āi
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.98,0:28:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome the bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.98,0:28:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome the groom!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.58,0:28:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, groom!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.84,0:28:34.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,660)}The tender spring breeze gently blows my skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.24,0:28:34.62,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k148}Chūn{\k164}fēng {\k73}fù {\k76}duō{\k164}qíng, {\k47}chuī {\k105}wǒ {\k103}luō {\k94}shang {\k264}kāi
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.62,0:28:47.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}In the morning I ascend to the balcony, and at dusk I rest in a pond of orchids.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.62,0:28:47.22,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k182}Cháo {\k151}dēng {\k81}liáng{\k85}tái {\k149}shàng, {\k45}xī {\k121}sù {\k87}lán {\k77}chí {\k282}lǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.22,0:28:59.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Under the moon I pluck hibiscus, and every night, I gather lotuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.37,0:28:59.02,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k173}Chéng {\k162}yuè {\k86}cǎi {\k67}fú{\k157}róng, {\k37}yè {\k110}yè {\k77}dé {\k98}lián{\k198}zǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.40,0:29:25.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}I lift my head to look at the empress tree \Nand gaze at its flowers with regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.87,0:29:25.10,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k144}Yǎng {\k159}tóu {\k99}kàn {\k64}tóng {\k143}shù, {\k48}tóng {\k128}huā {\k70}tè {\k96}kě{\k272}lián{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.10,0:29:37.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}How I wish Heaven does not bring snow so that I may contemplate them for a thousand years!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.30,0:29:37.58,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k167}Yuàn {\k151}tiān {\k84}wú {\k76}shuāng {\k129}xuě, {\k74}wú {\k110}zi {\k88}jiě {\k88}qiān{\k261}nián
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.58,0:29:50.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}The pool of ice is three {\i0}chi {\i1}thick.\N White snow spreads over a thousand{\i0} li.{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.08,0:29:50.38,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k166}Yuān {\k162}bīng {\k76}hòu {\k66}sān {\k154}chǐ, {\k52}sù {\k112}xuě {\k82}fù {\k78}qiān{\k282}lǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.38,0:30:02.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}My feelings are resilient like the pine leaves, \Ndoes my beloved think the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.58,0:30:02.90,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k170}Wǒ {\k170}xīn {\k74}rú {\k70}sōng{\k152}bǎi, {\k40}jūn {\k112}qíng {\k90}fù {\k104}hé {\k250}sì
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.93,0:30:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,670)}The rite may be modest, but the ceremony is grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.40,0:30:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}We venerate Heaven as the Earth is subservient, \Njust as the subjects venerate their sovereign.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.82,0:30:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}The man shall engage with the woman in marriage, like a phoenix joining with the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.66,0:30:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Since these rites were established, households have been joyful and the state flourishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.18,0:30:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}The newly wed shall pay their respects to Heaven and Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.84,0:31:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.51,0:31:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.56,0:31:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow to your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.13,0:31:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.57,0:31:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.81,0:32:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow to the matchmakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.37,0:32:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bride and groom, bow to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.10,0:32:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.98,0:32:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.92,0:32:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the newly wed to the bridal chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.88,0:33:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, do take good care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.51,0:33:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, you may drink wine in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.27,0:34:05.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.58,0:34:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My good sir, no need to worry. The mistress has studied military matters since she was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.38,0:34:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She often orders her maids to fence for fun. \NThat is what they are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.79,0:34:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The bridal chamber is a peaceful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.14,0:34:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Having troops and shows of might here seems chilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.10,0:34:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, there are weapons inside the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.84,0:34:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes your husband uneasy. \NShall they be removed?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.35,0:34:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been braving\N battlefields for half of your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.23,0:34:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you fear these weapons? Take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.68,0:34:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.76,0:34:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, enter the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.16,0:36:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.70,0:37:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at, Imperial Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.87,0:37:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because my looks displease you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.14,0:37:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all! Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.98,0:37:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I have roamed the land my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.54,0:37:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined that I would encounter such good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.42,0:37:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.51,0:37:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been involved with warfare \Nall your life, between swords and sabers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.93,0:37:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You have fought and killed. Why is it \Nthat some arms make you so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.87,0:37:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The bridal chamber is not the battlefield.\N Why would I see weapons there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.64,0:38:10.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lady, it is my wish that this beautiful moment accompanies me for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.75,0:38:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.62,0:38:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu has sent me to deliver this letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.08,0:39:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The fake marriage is real now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.52,0:39:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis deeply regrets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.76,0:39:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wisdom is above that \Nof common men, Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.62,0:39:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you let Liu Bei \Nand Zhuge Liang get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.53,0:39:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is celebrating victory too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.04,0:39:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your plan, Chief Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.05,0:39:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How do Liu Bei and Lady Sun get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.88,0:39:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They stick to each other like lacquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.28,0:39:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. Since that is the case, let Liu Bei soften up in Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.26,0:40:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Her lavish palaces shall be the tomb of his ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.53,0:40:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him beautiful women\N and treasures to entertain him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.40,0:40:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That will cause Liu Bei to indulge in pleasure\N and distance him from Guan Yu and Zhang Fei.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.77,0:40:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They will resent his proximity to Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.61,0:40:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I will then send an expedition to Jing\N and thus fulfill our great cause!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.88,0:40:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent plan. However, Liu Bei is a man of both ability and ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.35,0:40:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does not give in, what could we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.58,0:40:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei has had meager possessions since he was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.30,0:40:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He has been running throughout\N the world without enjoying life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.43,0:40:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we guide him towards it, will he really not give in?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.50,0:40:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He shall give in!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.26,0:41:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.60,0:41:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.93,0:41:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin's plan is just what I intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.40,0:41:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I just fear Liu Xuande will not stay here for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.21,0:41:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,According to this plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.63,0:41:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,if we build him palaces and grant him precious gifts,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.92,0:41:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,he will focus on good music and women. \NThose playthings will bury his ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.09,0:41:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He will grow soft and lose all desire to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.30,0:41:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,As time goes on, the officers of Jing \Nwill grow dissatisfied and demoralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.04,0:41:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If we mobilize the troops then, we can conquer Jing!
